{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-6","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If two magnitudes have to one another the ratio which a number has to a number, the magnitudes will be commensurable.","book":10,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","contentId":"euclid-10-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a457c0bf02986e84d1e81026929c42c4826f52067d93dba0d6e2fc5fbb0d9317","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-6.statement","euclid-10-6.construction.1","euclid-10-6.construction.2","euclid-10-6.proof.1","euclid-10-6.proof.2","euclid-10-6.proof.3","euclid-10-6.proof.4","euclid-10-6.proof.5","euclid-10-6.proof.6","euclid-10-6.proof.7","euclid-10-6.proof.8","euclid-10-6.proof.9","euclid-10-6.proof.10","euclid-10-6.proof.11","euclid-10-6.proof.12","euclid-10-6.proof.13","euclid-10-6.proof.14","euclid-10-6.conclusion","euclid-10-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4077930751d9ccc661fd63052ce6efb5e05ca114be0aa5315c53025613258316","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two magnitudes have to one another the ratio which a number has to a number, the magnitudes will be commensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个星等相对,数字对数的比,则星等为可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb45b4675785229421bf6af780fc69dfa9e0eae55f423a50c3b3a6d0903040e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two magnitudes A, B have to one another the ratio which the number D has to the number E; I say that the magnitudes A, B are commensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B这两个级必须相互对应,D级与E级的比;我说,A,B级是可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a636d9e04a3831da648ee97dea21574f15eefab8e04d63ea2f471df0d77b9821","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A be divided into as many equal parts as there are units in D, and let C be equal to one of them; and let F be made up of as many magnitudes equal to C as there are units in E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A单位分为D单位,C单位等于其中之一;F单位等于C单位。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2572f8d0289e1d49f3e72cebca6f14644f229b2c8433343406ea8d6710d592c","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then there are in A as many magnitudes equal to C as there are units in D, whatever part the unit is of D, the same part is C of A also; therefore, as C is to A, so is the unit to D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A等号等于C单位,D单位,无论单位是D单位,同一部分也是C单位,A单位的比是C单位,因此,C单位与A单位的比等于D单位 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37d46342458b184ca9594d28a40449edb3436b68ffe7aa0a015bb071166aa287","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit measures the number D; therefore C also measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但单位测量的数是D,因此C也测量了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12273e3a4eda7e932e48c686f09926189bc2147fd28837ae3a0d25495a6d0681","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as C is to A, so is the unit to D, therefore, inversely, as A is to C, so is the number D to the unit. [cf. [V. 7, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C对A的比等于单位对D的比,因此,A对C的比等于单位对D的比 [cf. [V. 7, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-7)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e9fe0fbbba1250856dbbfd02450097555617198a8d807caf497d401f16ccdea","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since there are in F as many magnitudes equal to C as there are units in E, therefore, as C is to F, so is the unit to E. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于F星等等于C单位,E单位,C单位与F单位的比等于E单位的比 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47a445d50b1a6f907b77d61599fc4d8beecb8a5256d48a35b718d77b84ecc9f8","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as A is to C, so is D to the unit; therefore, ex aequali, as A is to F, so is D to E. [[v. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,A对C的比等于D对单位的比;因此,从平等角度看,A对F的比等于D对E的比；A 与 F 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[v. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b01a881e078c9d395cf9f6d1c72380167eeeafe5d3374ca49b12a7153f5c699f","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as D is to E, so is A to B; therefore also, as A is to B, so is it to F also. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,D对E的比等于A对B的比;因此,A对B的比也等于F的比；D 与 E 之比等于 A 与 B 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 it 与 F 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a049d20e992d79ee3454810623d6bdf56cd16ec6f5912da2886109ed48f0e08","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A has the same ratio to each of the magnitudes B, F; therefore B is equal to F. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A星等与B、F星等的比相同;因此,B星等等于F星等。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c264af95f7ddd8a368aa9f3bd841e806072b16ee9bc28dbe8c4dbeed830b713","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But C measures F; therefore it measures B also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但有C项措施F,因此它也涉及B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7416a41738296f8510178d77f35a1a299d34718ea1d045ce184ebba32aa6e84","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Further it measures A also; therefore C measures A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此外,还采取了A项措施;因此,采取了C项措施,即A项措施,B项措施。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef477715f41ca8483248f4fd04e65350cec0386b10b32c416d244a21010fb2d4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A is commensurable with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A是可公度和B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1684c39bc683c698d400b790713ad55a89148b1daaf14d1b4d457014ef24b00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if there be two numbers, as D, E, and a straight line, as A, it is possible to make a straight line [F] such that the given straight line is to it as the number D is to the number E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱法。 从这一点可以明显看出,如果有两个数字,即D、E和一条直线,即A,那么可以设定一条直线[F],这样,给定的直线就是直线,因为D是直线,编号是E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef652110ec33717442d037a5960c33d776c75abee8716774728660a2292ae8f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if a mean proportional be also taken between A, F, as B,"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果比例中项也用A到F B"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b68062ffc511d4d8439a8b5a97947465c09c45dbab0b149e654dd4eaa471b2ed","citations":["euclid-6-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"as A is to F, so will the square on A be to the square on B, that is, as the first is to the third, so is the figure on the first to that which is similar and similarly described on the second. [[VI. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比F,A比正方形等于B比正方形,即第一个比3,第一个比3等于第一个比A比2,第二个相近。 [[VI. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72b22c18645c1f1d621c83f618906975feda3b3d5a2d71f13f5f4093b81682be","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to F, so is the number D to the number E; therefore it has been contrived that, as the number D is to the number E, so also is the figure on the straight line A to the figure on the straight line B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对F的比等于D对E的比;因此,人们推测,由于D对E的数字,因此,A对B对F的数字,A对B对Q"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-6.source","contentId":"euclid-10-6","revisionId":"euclid-10-6@raw-a457c0bf02986e84","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dd2874d5687f8dad50580eb0ede83d3b419d87e9459f2b87e3928ee8c3529ea4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-6:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-6.proof.1","euclid-10-6.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-6:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-6.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6/","sourceLabel":"V. 7, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-6:euclid-5-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-6.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6/","sourceLabel":"v. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-6:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-6.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-